{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SIN CARDS</strong> is a horror-themed card game where you must build the ultimate deck to survive the nightmares of the Netherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/A8.png?t=1743582731\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/A5.png?t=1743582731\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/A11.png?t=1743582731\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/A1.png?t=1743582731\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbCombine strategy and luck as you collect\u00a0 and purchase powerful cards, craft deadly combos, and face off against terrifying monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/A6.png?t=1743582731\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/A9.png?t=1743582731\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/A15.png?t=1743582731\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/A14.png?t=1743582731\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbDemons gradually grow stronger and more aggressive under the control of Delilah, the sinister voice of the Netherworld, a manipulative and mocking presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/darkfantasy-disciple.png?t=1743582731\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/hellmaw.png?t=1743582731\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/darkfantasy-enthralled.png?t=1743582731\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbEach level introduces increasing difficulty and new mechanics like crafting, mining, and fishing. Craft hero items using resources and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/Items1.png?t=1743582731\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/111.png?t=1743582731\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/222.png?t=1743582731\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbCreepy choices, eerie sounds, and sudden jumpscares will have you second-guessing every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/tweety.png?t=1743582731\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/swarm_exploder.png?t=1743582731\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbEach new level reveals more lore about the Sin Cards and the demons that inhabit the world.\u00a0Some say the choices you make reveal the lengths you're willing to go to <span class=\"bb_strike\">survive</span> permadeath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/TESTDeckIcon.png?t=1743582731\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411930?t=1743582731","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743582731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/ec80a495196d48afe5d5ccebdd2477cff60cd96f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743582731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/ec80a495196d48afe5d5ccebdd2477cff60cd96f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743582731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"SIN CARDS feature mature themes, including blood, gore, and suggestive imagery. Rooms may also be filled with blood and eerie sounds."},"demos":[{"appid":3414590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SIN CARDS</strong> is a horror-themed card game where you must build the ultimate deck to survive the nightmares of the Netherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/A8.png?t=1743582731\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/A5.png?t=1743582731\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/A11.png?t=1743582731\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/A1.png?t=1743582731\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbCombine strategy and luck as you collect\u00a0 and purchase powerful cards, craft deadly combos, and face off against terrifying monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/A6.png?t=1743582731\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/A9.png?t=1743582731\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a