82731\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbEach new level reveals more lore about the Sin Cards and the demons that inhabit the world.\u00a0Some say the choices you make reveal the lengths you're willing to go to <span class=\"bb_strike\">survive</span> permadeath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/TESTDeckIcon.png?t=1743582731\" /></p>","developers":["Wynand Smit"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/header.jpg?t=1743582731","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120320,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120320/movie480.mp4?t=1743398051","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120320/movie_max.mp4?t=1743398051"},"name":"SIN CARDS Trailer V1.4","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257120320/f3cf5d6c13578e2b72ff8a9abaa45d7cb0a8dcca/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743398051","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120320/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743398051","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120320/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743398051"}}],"name":"SIN CARDS: Welcome to the Netherworld","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"SIN CARDS: Welcome to the Netherworld - $5.99 USD","packageid":1206811,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":599}],"title":"Buy SIN CARDS: Welcome to the Netherworld"}],"packages":[1206811],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"b